  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 🟥 Cluster 0 (157 Customer)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "- **Average Customer Age:** 42 Years old\n",
    "- **Gender Dominant:** Male\n",
    "- **Income Level Dominant:** High\n",
    "- **Average Purchase Ammount:** $147.62\n",
    "- **Average Purchase Frequency:** 5/month\n",
    "- **Brand_Loyalty Rate:** 3.27/5\n",
    "- **Loyalty Program Members:** 54.8/100% (86/157)\n",
    "- **Top Purchase Category:** Animal Feed, Hotels, Arts & Crafts\n",
    "- **Purchase Channel Dominant:** In Store\n",
    "- **Most Purchase Intent:** Impulsive\n",
    "- **Most Marital Status:** Married\n",
    "\n",
    "💡**Insight:**\n",
    "\n",
    "The first group is dominated by adult to elderly men who are married, around 42 years old, and have high incomes. The average age of customers also appears to influence the average total purchases made, where the average total purchase recorded is the lowest compared to other groups, at **$147.62**. This means that customers in the adult-to-elderly age range tend to shop in very small amounts (as age increases, total spending also tends to decrease), even though the average income level in this group is high.\n",
    "\n",
    "Customers in this group make purchases approximately **5 times per month**, with the most frequently purchased categories being **Animal Feed, Hotels, and Arts & Crafts**. Interestingly, they are quite loyal to the brands they buy, with a **65% loyalty rate**, and approximately **86 people** in this group have created and own a membership card. Their reasons for purchasing products are based on **impulsive decisions**, without much consideration. Customers in this group also often buy products **directly in-store**.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 🟩 Cluster 1 (181 Customer)"
