    "- **Brand_Loyalty Rate:** 4.49/5\n",
    "- **Loyalty Program Members:** 46.5/100% (86/185)\n",
    "- **Top Purchase Category:** Home Appliances, Sports & Outdoors, Food & Beverages\n",
