    "- **Most Purchase Intent:** Wants-based\n",
    "- **Most Marital Status:** Single\n",
    "\n",
    "💡**Insight:**\n",
    "\n",
    "The third group is dominated by adult men who are single (unmarried), around 37 years old, and have high incomes. The spending level for product purchases in this group is neither too high nor too low, averaging **$249.61**, with a purchase frequency of **10 times per month**. The relatively high purchase frequency is influenced by marital status, as most customers in this group are unmarried.\n",
    "\n",
    "This group has the **highest brand loyalty** compared to other groups, at **90%**, even though only **46.5%** (86 people) in this group participate in the membership program. The top product categories purchased by this group are **Home Appliances, Sports & Outdoors, and Food & Beverages**, with purchases driven by **desire**.\n",
    "\n",
    "Customers in this group shop through both **online and offline stores (mixed)**.\n"
