    "\n",
    "With women as the dominant gender, the product categories they purchase include Jewelry & Accessories and Gardening & Outdoors, although the most frequently purchased category is Sports & Outdoors. Customers in this group are also very loyal to the brands they buy, with a loyalty level similar to the third group, at 81%, and 84 customers in this group hold a membership card.\n",
