    "\n",
    "The products most frequently purchased by this group are **Health Supplements, Furniture, and Gardening & Outdoors**. Customers in this group tend to buy products from **various brands**, as shown by their very low loyalty rate of **only 39.8%**. Interestingly, despite the low loyalty, as many as **56.8%** of customers in this group (**96 people**) hold or participate in a membership program.\n",
